---
const { heroSection } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="space-y-10">
  <h1 class="max-w-xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
    {heroSection.title}
  </h1>

  <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed text-para">
      The Akash Network Token (AKT) acts as the programmatic clearing mechanism that drives the network's decentralized cloud economics. By handling protocol-level transaction logic natively, the system completely bypasses traditional cloud provider markups to deliver direct, frictionless, market-driven pricing straight to your infrastructure layer.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed text-para">
      For enterprise engineering teams, the underlying complexity is entirely abstracted away. While the open marketplace settles high-velocity computing auctions via AKT in the background, your organization deploys workloads seamlessly using standard corporate billing. This marries enterprise-grade compliance with raw commodity infrastructure rates.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
